        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.84,
          "end": 60.62,
          "en": "and there, you will also find instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.62,
          "end": 64.43,
          "en": "on how to integrate TypeScript for dev.",
