        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.73,
          "end": 80.73,
          "en": "So the way you find those instructions might change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.73,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "but you can also google for Create React App TypeScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.26,
