        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.24,
          "end": 148.32,
          "en": "So if you grab that, we can run this command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 151.55,
          "en": "And here, what I'll do is I'll open a terminal",
