          "end": 366.84,
          "en": "I wanna talk about our dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 366.84,
          "end": 368.855,
          "en": "in the package.json file though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 368.855,
          "end": 372.68,
          "en": "In there, we generally got the same dependencies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 372.68,
          "end": 375.795,
          "en": "as before react and react-dom and react-scripts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 375.795,
          "end": 379.9,
          "en": "but we also see a couple of extra dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 379.9,
          "end": 382.89,
          "en": "Specifically, we find typescript in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 382.89,
          "end": 386.133,
          "en": "and also these types dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 387.03,
          "end": 388.55,
          "en": "Now typescript, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 388.55,
          "end": 392.03,
          "en": "is the language to compiler for TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.03,
          "end": 394.34000000000003,
          "en": "which is installed into this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 394.34000000000003,
          "end": 397.67,
          "en": "so that we can use TypeScript in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 397.67,
          "end": 402.1,
          "en": "That's also what we had in this ts-basics part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 402.1,
          "end": 404.32,
          "en": "we worked on in the last lectures,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 404.32,
          "end": 406.983,
          "en": "there we also installed TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 408.043,
          "end": 411.416,
          "en": "But we now also have these extra types packages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 411.416,
          "end": 414.043,
          "en": "and these are important packages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 414.043,
          "end": 419.043,
          "en": "These @types packages act as translation bridges",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 420.72,
          "end": 424.16,
          "en": "between Vanilla JavaScript libraries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 424.16,
          "end": 427.04,
          "en": "and TypeScript projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 427.04,
          "end": 430.94,
          "en": "So for example, we're using react and react-dom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 430.94,
          "end": 432.97,
          "en": "as libraries in this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 432.97,
          "end": 435.73,
          "en": "and these two libraries are, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
